  "prefLabel": "Acp 704.05 Reciprocal Discipline",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 704.05 Reciprocal Discipline. When the board receives notice that a certificate holder has been subjected to suspension or revocation of a certificate without subsequent reinstatement, the board shall issue an order directing the certificate holder to demonstrate why reciprocal discipline should not be imposed in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #12575, eff 7-20-18",
